Shift PDF third-party notices
=============================

This file lists third-party components shipped with Shift PDF that are not
covered by the AGPL-3.0-only license of this repository. AGPL processing
engines (PyMuPDF, Ghostscript, CoherentPDF) have their own corresponding-source
links on licensing.html and in src/js/const/engine-source.ts.

Do not patch the LibreOffice WASM blobs in place.

